       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-AMT      PIC 9(7)V99.
       01 WS-RAW      PIC X(12).
       01 WS-NOW      PIC X(21).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-RAW) TO WS-AMT
           MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
           COMPUTE WS-AMT = FUNCTION MAX(WS-AMT, 100)
           CALL "CALC-TAX" USING WS-AMT
           CALL "CEEMOUT" USING WS-NOW
           CALL "CEE3ABD"
           CALL "MISSING-PROG" USING WS-AMT
           STOP RUN.
       CALC-TAX.
           COMPUTE WS-AMT = WS-AMT * 0.8
           EXIT.
